/vendor/lensisku/dictionary-*.json -text

# The smusni-v0 bundle retains byte-exact mirrors of every source its generator
# compiled against, and `crates/jbotci-semantics/build.rs` compares each mirror
# against its live counterpart on every build. Git decides end-of-line
# conversion per path, so a mirror and the file it snapshots that disagree about
# the `text` attribute drift apart on a Windows checkout and nowhere else. Check
# both sides of every such path out verbatim instead, along with the bundle's
# own retained sources, whose digests the same build recomputes.
# `crates/jbotci-semantics/tests/smusni_v0_bundle.rs` keeps this closed over the
# generator's own inventory rather than over these patterns.
/Cargo.lock -text
/Cargo.toml -text
/crates/bityzba/** -text
/crates/bityzba-contract-syntax/** -text
/crates/bityzba-macros/** -text
/crates/jbotci-dictionary-data/data/** -text
/crates/jbotci-semantics/** -text
